e meow card you wish to carry into battle. Each cat can only carry one meow card per battle.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345550/extras/d025c878fb3ff619d8d17127bf64c819.poster.avif?t=1711995359\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345550/extras/d025c878fb3ff619d8d17127bf64c819.webm?t=1711995359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345550/extras/d025c878fb3ff619d8d17127bf64c819.mp4?t=1711995359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li>Upgrade your cat cards: There are three levels of cat cards, and the higher the level, the more attribute boosts you get. You can <strong>level up</strong> by merging them.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345550/extras/a4e5773d62f6ff14dc1c1b0bdff92744.poster.avif?t=1711995359\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345550/extras/a4e5773d62f6ff14dc1c1b0bdff92744.webm?t=1711995359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345550/extras/a4e5773d62f6ff14dc1c1b0bdff92744.mp4?t=1711995359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></li></ul>",
